[68ec1212] 2026-11-02T08:30:45.025Z: When comparing dates, be aware that some years in the 19th and early 20th centuries used two-digit century codes in their date formats, potentially causing issues with century-based comparisons.
[31a61d78] 2026-11-02T08:10:45.711Z: Four attempts to parse US state capitals, still stuck on Alaska. Look for a non-alpha character in the state name — that's the giveaway.
[2061cdce] 2026-09-30T07:21:16.291Z: When joining on state_fips and county_fips, I noticed that some counties have duplicate FIPS codes in different states. I padded county_fips with a leading zero to ensure uniqueness, which resolved the issue.